<div style="color:#111111;" class="rounded p-6 gap-3" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:2:36"><p>
	<span style="color:#ed1c2b;"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;">Donate Online</span></strong></span>
</p>

<p>
	It’s Secure, quick, and easy. Your funds are used in your community where the needs are the greatest. You can also become a Monthly Sustainer or give an Honor/Memorial gift. 
</p>

<p class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start"><a href="https://give.salvationarmygeorgia.org/give/522199/#!/donation/checkout" class="btn btn-primary gap-1 mt-2">Donate Online</a></p>

<p>
	<span style="color:#ed1c2b;"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;">Donate by Mail</span></strong></span>
</p>

<p>
	To donate by mail, please send a check directly to your local Salvation Army.
</p>

<p>
	<span style="color:#ed1c2b;"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;">Donate By Phone</span></strong></span>
</p>

<p>
	To donate by phone, please call:
</p>

<p>
	1-800-SAL-ARMY<br>
	(<a href="tel:+18007252769">1-800-725-2769</a>)
</p>

<p>
	Credit card donations are accepted.
</p>

<p>
	<span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#ed1c2b;"><strong>Make a Major Gift</strong></span></span>
</p>

<p>
	<a href="https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/augusta/major-gifts" target="">Learn more about Major Gifts</a>, how to make a large donation, an outright gift, gifts of stock, cash, real estate, gifts-in-kind, or corporate gifts-in-kind.
</p>

<p>
	<span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#ed1c2b;"><strong>Make a Planned Gift</strong></span></span>
</p>

<p>
	<a href="https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/augusta/planned-giving" target="">Learn more about Planned Giving</a>, how to make an estate or Will gift, and/or give through gift annuities &amp; trusts.
</p>

<p>
	<span style="font-size:16px;"><span style="color:#ed1c2b;"><strong>Give to Project Share</strong></span></span>
</p>

<p>
	<a href="https://projectshareinfo.com/" target="">Learn more about Project Share</a>, a program that provides Financial Emergency Assistance to individuals and families facing a temporary crisis that threatens their homes. Project SHARE attempts to target the most urgent need, whether it is a utility bill, a part of a rent payment, or an emergency prescription. Donate through your Georgia Power or Gas South bill today.
</p>

<p>
	<span style="color:#ed1c2b;"><strong>Donate a Vehicle </strong></span>
</p>

<p>
	<a href="https://salvationarmygeorgia.careasy.org/home" target="">Learn more about donating a vehicle.</a> Have a vehicle you no longer need? Donate it and help us drive change in the Augusta area.
</p></div>
